## Commands
- **Dev server**: `{{DEV_COMMAND}}` (run ONLY when explicitly requested by user)
- **Run tests**: `{{TEST_COMMAND}}`
- **Single test**: `{{SINGLE_TEST_COMMAND}}`
- **Build**: `{{BUILD_COMMAND}}`

## Architecture & Code Conventions

- **Core Patterns**: {{TECH_STACK}} conventions.
- **Business Logic**: Keep UI components thin. Offload calculations and pure functions to `{{SERVICES_DIR}}`.
- **GitFlow Branching**: `main` (prod), `dev` (integration), `feature/*` (features), `bugfix/*` (patches).
- **Security**: Never hardcode secrets; sanitize user inputs; enforce zero-trust data protection.

## Verification Loop
Always run `{{TEST_COMMAND}}` after modifying code to verify zero regressions before ending your turn.
